<p> R.Kaluwitharana c and Streak		 71</p>
<p> K.Dharmasena not out			   16</p>
<p> C.Vaas not out				    3</p>
<p> Extras (lb-6 nb-7 w-1)			 14</p>
<p> Total (seven wickets)			 290</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-4 2-4 3-53 4-105 5-128 6-270 7-271</p>
<p>To bat: M.Muralitharan, J.Silva.</p>
<p>Bowling: Streak 17-5-41-3, Olonga 14-2-46-2, G.Whittall</p>
